          {
            "title": "Question: Any number",
            "id": 73310,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir dizinin tutabileceği maksimum değer sayısı nedir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">İstediğimiz kadar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">10</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İstediğimiz kadar.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir çalma listesi dizisi 3 şarkıdan 12 şarkıya çıkıyor. Aynı dizi 12 şarkının tamamını tutabilir mi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Evet, bir dizi ihtiyaç duyduğumuz kadar değer tutabilir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hayır, bir dizi yalnızca bir değer tutabilir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hayır, bir dizi onuncu değerden sonra değer kabul etmeyi bırakır</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Evet, ancak önce ilk üç şarkının yerini değiştirirsek</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Evet, bir dizi ihtiyaç duyduğumuz kadar değer tutabilir.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Element",
            "id": 73903,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Öğe nedir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir dizideki değer</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir dizi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Bir dizinin koşulu</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir dizideki değer.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>const scores = [8, 10, 9]</code> içinde hangi seçenek bir öğedir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10</code> değeri</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[8, 10, 9]</code> dizisinin tamamı</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>10</code> değerini bulmak için kullanılan dizin</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores</code> değişken adı</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>10</code> değeri öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Value in an array",
            "id": 73269,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>toDo</code> değişkenine <code>\"Feed Clawdius\"</code> değerini içeren bir dizi ata.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Feed Clawdius&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;To Do:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Feed Darian&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"To Do:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[ 'Feed Clawdius' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>\"Feed Clawdius\"</code> ve son olarak <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Square brackets",
            "id": 73271,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"classic\"</code> ve <code>\"dark mode\"</code> değerlerini saklayan bir dizi oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(themes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'classic', 'dark mode' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"classic\"</code> ve <code>\"dark mode\"</code> değerlerini saklayan bir dizi oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(themes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"theme\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"styles\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"modes\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'classic', 'dark mode' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>themes</code>, ardından <code>[</code> ve son olarak <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Empty array",
            "id": 73313,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shoppingList = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(shoppingList);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ \"\" ]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ shoppingList ]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[]</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu diziyi loglamadan önce <code>.push()</code> ile <code>\"milk\"</code> eklediğini düşün. Konsol ne gösterirdi?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shoppingList = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(shoppingList);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[ \"milk\" ]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ \"\", \"milk\" ]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[ \"milk\" ]</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Start at zero",
            "id": 73926,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"lightBlue\"</code>'nun dizin değeri nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" colorScheme = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lightBlue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;grey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>0</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>colorScheme</code> dizisinden <code>\"lightBlue\"</code> değerini hangi ifade alır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" colorScheme = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lightBlue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;grey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>colorScheme[0]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>colorScheme[1]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>colorScheme[-1]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>colorScheme(0)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>colorScheme[0]</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Change value",
            "id": 73974,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İkinci öğeyi <code>\"Lee\"</code> olarak güncelle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" missedCalls = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lou&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Zoe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"missedCalls[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(missedCalls);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"missedCalls[2]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Robert&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Lou', 'Lee' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>missedCalls[1]</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>\"Lee\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Valid index",
            "id": 73931,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu dizide erişebileceğimiz son indeks nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ordersDelivered = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>2</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizide üç teslimat değeri var ve dizinler <code>0</code>'dan başlıyor. Geçerli son dizin hangisidir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ordersDelivered = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Üçüncü değerin dizini olan <code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dizide üç değer olduğu için <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Son değer <code>true</code> olduğu için <code>4</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca <code>false</code> değerleri sayıldığı için <code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Üçüncü değerin dizini olan <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Start at zero",
            "id": 73980,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"Meg\"</code> kodunu <code>0</code> dizininde ve <code>\"Max\"</code> kodunu <code>1</code> dizininde yaz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Meg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(players);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Meg', 'Max' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"Meg\"</code>, ardından <code>\"Max\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"Meg\"</code> kodunu <code>0</code> dizininde ve <code>\"Max\"</code> kodunu <code>1</code> dizininde yaz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Meg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(players);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"push\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"shift\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Meg', 'Max' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"Meg\"</code>, ardından <code>\"Max\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Access element",
            "id": 73925,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu dizideki <code>22</code> değerine nasıl erişiriz?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bingoAnswer = [\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>bingoAnswer[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer(2)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>bingoAnswer[2]</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>22</code> değeri <code>bingoAnswer</code> dizisinde üçüncü sırada. Bu değeri hangi ifade alır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bingoAnswer = [\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>bingoAnswer[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer(2)</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer[22]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>bingoAnswer[2]</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pop",
            "id": 74092,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.pop()</code> ne yapar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir dizinin son değerini kaldırır</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir dizinin ilk değerini kaldırır</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Bir dizinin rastgele bir değerini kaldırır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir dizinin son değerini kaldırır.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>[\"email\", \"call\", \"meeting\"]</code> üzerinde <code>tasks.pop()</code> çağrısı yapıyorsun. Ne olur?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"meeting\"</code> değerini kaldırır ve döndürür</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"email\"</code> değerini kaldırır ve döndürür</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Üç görevden birini rastgele kaldırır</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code> döndürür ve üç görevi de korur</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"meeting\"</code> değerini kaldırır ve döndürür.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Push",
            "id": 74095,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.push()</code> ne yapar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir diziye değer ekler</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Diziden bir değer kaldırır</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Bir dizi oluşturur</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir diziye değer ekler.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>forecast.push(\"windy\")</code> işleminden sonra <code>[\"sunny\", \"cloudy\"]</code> dizisine ne olur?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"sunny\", \"cloudy\", \"windy\"]</code> olur</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"sunny\", \"windy\"]</code> olur</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ayrı bir <code>[\"windy\"]</code> dizisi oluşturur</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"windy\", \"sunny\", \"cloudy\"]</code> olur</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[\"sunny\", \"cloudy\", \"windy\"]</code> olur.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Push",
            "id": 74090,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu hava durumu tahmini dizisine <code>\"windy\"</code> ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" forecast = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sunny&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cloudy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"forecast.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;windy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(forecast);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;rainy&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'sunny', 'cloudy', 'windy' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>forecast</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve sonra <code>push</code>, <code>\"windy\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: End of the array",
            "id": 74094,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>push()</code> ile ekledikten sonra dizide <code>\"salami\"</code> öğesinin indeksi nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toppings = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;mozarella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toppings.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;salami&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toppings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[ 'mozarella', 'salami' ]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gösterilen <code>push()</code> işleminden sonra <code>\"salami\"</code> değerini hangi dizin alır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toppings = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;mozarella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toppings.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;salami&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toppings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[ 'mozarella', 'salami' ]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>toppings.push[1]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Store removed element",
            "id": 74091,
            "contentType": "interactive",
